# Current shells and builds require no environment variables.
# Put provider secrets in apps/platform/.env.local as integrations are implemented.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ and EXPO_PUBLIC_ values are public; never use them for secrets.
# Better Auth server setup uses DATABASE_URL (pooled), DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED
# (schema tooling), BETTER_AUTH_SECRET, and BETTER_AUTH_URL.
# BETTER_AUTH_API_KEY enables the privileged infrastructure dashboard integration;
# add it only after approving that connection. Keep every value server-only.
